## Lore

The N''retas are anteater-like D-Bees of the Mexican frontier, stocky
humanoids with long tubular snouts, sticky prehensile tongues, bushy tails,
four-fingered hands and clear white eyes. Their fur runs from deep indigo and
violet to nearly black, with white, grey or pale blue on the face, belly and
streaked through a crest of hair they style into Mohawks; the bare skin of
hands, feet and snout is a pale lilac.

They have lived on Earth for many generations, call themselves Earthlings,
wear Mexican clothes, eat Mexican food (as far as a toothless mouth allows,
and they adore chicharrones) and are largely Christian. Many believe the Rifts
gathered so many peoples on Earth to teach that beauty lies in diversity, and
that Earth''s people will one day carry that message across the Megaverse.
They settle along rivers, because water keeps vampires away, so some are
boatmen and river pirates as well as farmers, bandits and priests.

Their own language of whistles, slurps, clicks and trumpeting is nearly
impossible for others to learn, and their mouths cannot form most other
tongues, though they understand Spanish and usually American. Mexicans treat
them as neighbors and equals; northerners often mistake their quiet faces for
coldness.

## GM Notes

Disposition: kind, sincere, caring and helpful, trusting others until that
trust is betrayed. Their faith gives them a broad view that includes every
intelligent being.

Size 5-6 feet (1.5 to 1.8 m). Weight 135-265 pounds (61 to 119 kg). Life span
3D6+60 years; mature by 13. Females bear twins, one male and one female. Also
called Ritas, Nosey N''retas or Big Nosed Ritas.

Equipment with no catalog row: a cross necklace. About half own a language
translator.

Habitat: the northern and central Mexican Frontier, almost always along rivers
or lakes, especially the Mexican Empire, Ciudad Victoria, the San Marcos River
and the Rio Bravo; also the Rio Grande, the Red River and the lower
Mississippi, and a few as far north as the Chi-Town ''Burbs. Slave market value
2D6x100 credits. Allies: they get on with Grackle Tooth, Kraks, Fingertooth
Carpetbaggers, Fennodi, Cactus People, Floopers, Shapers, most humans,
Psi-Stalkers and Tokanii. Enemies: all but the most evil hate vampires and
other undead, except those living in the Mexican Empire; they distrust the
Coalition and the Minions of Splugorth. N''retas can be made vampires and use
an ice pick, scalpel or knife in place of fangs.
